00:10:54,560 --> 00:10:55,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">You've got that whole...</font></font>

337
00:10:55,720 --> 00:10:57,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">retro countryside look going on.</font></font>

338
00:10:58,720 --> 00:11:00,280
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">With that outfit, you look so...</font></font>

339
00:11:00,280 --> 00:11:01,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Artsy. Really artsy.</font></font>

340
00:11:01,680 --> 00:11:02,760
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">The opposite of a show-off.</font></font>

341
00:11:02,760 --> 00:11:03,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Super artsy.</font></font>

342
00:11:04,040 --> 00:11:07,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">[Still watching]</font></font>

343
00:11:08,520 --> 00:11:09,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">They're so artsy.</font></font>

344
00:11:09,880 --> 00:11:10,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">So artsy.</font></font>

345
00:11:15,680 --> 00:11:19,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">[Glancing over]</font></font>

346
00:11:19,680 --> 00:11:21,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Can we leave the bikes here?</font></font>

347
00:11:21,560 --> 00:11:22,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I don't know. Probably.</font></font>

348
00:11:26,200 --> 00:11:31,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">[Following her with his eyes]</font></font>

349
00:11:45,000 --> 00:11:48,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">[Heading toward the bikes]</font></font>

350
00:11:48,840 --> 00:11:52,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">[Moving slowly]</font></font>

351
00:12:12,400 --> 00:12:14,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Want to ride at sunset?</font></font>

352
00:12:14,520 --> 00:12:15,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Yeah, I was waiting for you.</font></font>

353
00:12:15,640 --> 00:12:16,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Then we'll wait for...</font></font>

354
00:12:16,440 --> 00:12:17,280
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">You looked exhausted,</font></font>

355
00:12:17,280 --> 00:12:18,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">so I thought I'd let you rest.</font></font>

356
00:12:18,880 --> 00:12:20,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Let's wait till sunset.</font></font>

357
00:12:20,240 --> 00:12:20,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Okay.</font></font>

358
00:12:20,680 --> 00:12:21,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Let's check when the sun sets.</font></font>

359
00:12:22,720 --> 00:12:24,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">It's 5:30 now.</font></font>

360
00:12:24,080 --> 00:12:25,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">So in a couple of hours.</font></font>

361
00:12:25,120 --> 00:12:26,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Find out if we can keep the bikes</font></font>

362
00:12:26,320 --> 00:12:28,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">until sunset.</font></font>

363
00:12:28,400 --> 00:12:29,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I'll put them away in a minute.</font></font>

364
00:12:36,360 --> 00:12:37,760
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Let's see how the baking went.</font></font>

365
00:12:37,760 --> 00:12:38,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">The dining hall.</font></font>

366
00:12:41,040 --> 00:12:41,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Can I film this?</font></font>

367
00:12:41,960 --> 00:12:42,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Yeah.</font></font>

368
00:12:44,920 --> 00:12:46,280
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Did it work?</font></font>

369
00:12:46,280 --> 00:12:47,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I think it did.</font></font>

370
00:12:48,080 --> 00:12:49,280
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Stick a chopstick in to check.</font></font>

371
00:12:49,280 --> 00:12:50,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Yeah.</font></font>

372
00:12:50,120 --> 00:12:50,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Look.</font></font>

373
00:12:52,360 --> 00:12:53,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">It's done.</font></font>

374
00:12:54,120 --> 00:12:55,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">It's done. Let's take it out of the pan.</font></font>

375
00:12:56,280 --> 00:12:57,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Let's loosen it around the edges.</font></font>

376
00:12:59,760 --> 00:13:02,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Sure. Lift it out, then we'll...</font></font>

377
00:13:02,320 --> 00:13:04,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Do we have any frosting to decorate it?</font></font>

378
00:13:04,360 --> 00:13:06,280
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Yeah, I think we can save it.</font></font>

379
00:13:06,680 --> 00:13:07,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Just spread it on?</font></font>

380
00:13:10,880 --> 00:13:11,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I think so.</font></font>

381
00:13:11,640 --> 00:13:13,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Like putting makeup on the moon.</font></font>

382
00:13:13,160 --> 00:13:14,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Exactly.</font></font>

383
00:13:14,160 --> 00:13:15,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">It's getting sadder by the swipe.</font></font>

384
00:13:16,880 --> 00:13:17,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">It's a moon.</font></font>

385
00:13:17,960 --> 00:13:19,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Yeah. The Moon of Affection.</font></font>

386
00:13:19,560 --> 00:13:20,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Yeah.</font></font>

387
00:13:20,600 --> 00:13:21,280
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Yeah.</font></font>

388
00:13:21,280 --> 00:13:22,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">We did that on purpose.</font></font>

389
00:13:22,240 --> 00:13:22,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Right.</font></font>

390
00:13:22,520 --> 00:13:24,760
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Let's put some nuts on top.</font></font>

391
00:13:24,760 --> 00:13:26,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">You know what this looks like?</font></font>

392
00:13:26,880 --> 00:13:27,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">A starry sky.</font></font>

393
00:13:27,920 --> 00:13:28,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Yeah.</font></font>

394
00:13:28,600 --> 00:13:29,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Yeah.</font></font>

395
00:13:30,280 --> 00:13:31,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Let's call it the Moon of Affection.</font></font>

396
00:13:31,920 --> 00:13:32,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">What do you think?</font></font>

397
00:13:32,240 --> 00:13:32,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Yeah.</font></font>

398
00:13:33,400 --> 00:13:35,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I think we're baking geniuses.</font></font>

399
00:13:36,680 --> 00:13:39,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">We've maxed out our cooking skills.</font></font>

400
00:13:39,000 --> 00:13:39,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Seriously.</font></font>

401
00:13:39,440 --> 00:13:41,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">We can just wing it and it works.</font></font>

402
00:13:41,920 --> 00:13:42,760
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Right, Yang?</font></font>

403
00:13:43,960 --> 00:13:46,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I'm the official witness to their happiness.</font></font>

404
00:13:46,720 --> 00:13:47,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">All afternoon,</font></font>

405
00:13:47,640 --> 00:13:48,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I was filming them, too.</font></font>

406
00:13:49,880 --> 00:13:50,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">How do we stick this in?</font></font>

407
00:13:50,720 --> 00:13:51,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">You can eat that.</font></font>

408
00:13:55,200 --> 00:13:56,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Get a shot of this.</font></font>

409
00:13:56,800 --> 00:13:57,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">That's so cute.</font></font>

410
00:13:57,720 --> 00:13:58,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Yeah, it looks lovely.</font></font>

411
00:13:59,080 --> 00:13:59,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I'm already used to</font></font>

412
00:13:59,960 --> 00:14:02,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">being their third wheel.</font></font>

413
00:14:04,160 --> 00:14:04,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Who's here?</font></font>

414
00:14:05,720 --> 00:14:06,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Hi, guys.</font></font>

415
00:14:06,360 --> 00:14:08,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">How'd you do?</font></font>

416
00:14:08,200 --> 00:14:09,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Look.</font></font>

417
00:14:09,680 --> 00:14:11,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Is that cake?</font></font>

418
00:14:12,200 --> 00:14:13,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">[By the baking team]</font></font>

419
00:14:13,960 --> 00:14:15,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Doesn't it look artsy?</font></font>

420
00:14:15,560 --> 00:14:17,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Is this waiting for us to eat?</font></font>

421
00:14:17,600 --> 00:14:18,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">It smells so good.</font></font>

422
00:14:18,720 --> 00:14:19,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Now I'm a little hungry.</font></font>

423
00:14:19,800 --> 00:14:21,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Come see what's in this pan.</font></font>

424
00:14:28,040 --> 00:14:28,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Where are you going?</font></font>

425
00:14:29,480 --> 00:14:30,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I'm going back.</font></font>

426
00:14:30,440 --> 00:14:31,760
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Okay, I'll go back too.</font></font>

427
00:14:33,200 --> 00:14:34,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Why are you going back all of a sudden?</font></font>

428
00:14:35,880 --> 00:14:37,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I want to look for...</font></font>

429
00:14:37,960 --> 00:14:39,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">[Plans to watch the sunset with Ren Chunxi]</font></font>

430
00:14:40,720 --> 00:14:42,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Do you have a shirt I could borrow?</font></font>

431
00:14:42,400 --> 00:14:44,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">They're all in the wash.</font></font>

432
00:14:44,360 --> 00:14:45,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">You could try this one.</font></font>

433
00:14:46,120 --> 00:14:47,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">That works. Can I borrow it for a bike ride?</font></font>

434
00:14:47,840 --> 00:14:48,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Sure.</font></font>

435
00:14:48,440 --> 00:14:49,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">[Changes into a shirt just for the ride]</font></font>

436
00:14:49,360 --> 00:14:51,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I did a little prep before the ride.</font></font>

437
00:14:51,680 --> 00:14:52,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I felt like</font></font>

438
00:14:52,840 --> 00:14:54,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I'd dressed a little too casually,</font></font>

439
00:14:54,360 --> 00:14:55,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">so I asked my roommate</font></font>

440
00:14:55,520 --> 00:14:57,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">if I could borrow a blue shirt.</font></font>

441
00:14:57,360 --> 00:14:59,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I wanted her to see</font></font>

442
00:14:59,520 --> 00:15:01,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">[Making an effort]
that I was excited to be with her</font></font>

443
00:15:01,480 --> 00:15:02,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">and that it mattered to me.</font></font>

444
00:15:02,680 --> 00:15:03,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">[It matters to him]</font></font>

445
00:15:06,120 --> 00:15:06,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Let's go.</font></font>

446
00:15:07,120 --> 00:15:07,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Let's go.</font></font>

447
00:15:08,240 --> 00:15:10,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Can I leave my bag with...</font></font>

448
00:15:10,160 --> 00:15:11,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Give it to me.</font></font>

449
00:15:11,120 --> 00:15:11,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">[Offers to carry her bag]
I'll take it for you.</font></font>

450
00:15:11,920 --> 00:15:13,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Our bike has a basket.</font></font>

451
00:15:14,440 --> 00:15:15,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">So you like watching the sunset?</font></font>

452
00:15:15,880 --> 00:15:17,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I do.</font></font>

453
00:15:17,760 --> 00:15:18,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Like this.</font></font>

454
00:15:18,360 --> 00:15:19,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">[Affection Photo Shoot]
I want something around sunset.</font></font>

455
00:15:19,640 --> 00:15:20,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">You two...</font></font>

456
00:15:20,920 --> 00:15:22,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Isn't that what the beach is for?</font></font>

457
00:15:22,720 --> 00:15:24,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">[Making up for the sunset photo they missed]</font></font>

458
00:15:25,200 --> 00:15:25,760
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Let's ride.</font></font>

459
00:15:25,760 --> 00:15:26,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I'll take the shortest one.</font></font>

460
00:15:26,360 --> 00:15:27,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I'll take a taller one.</font></font>

461
00:15:27,720 --> 00:15:29,280
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Want me to lower the seat?</font></font>

462
00:15:29,760 --> 00:15:31,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I'm not that short.</font></font>

463
00:15:31,400 --> 00:15:32,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I've got this.</font></font>

464
00:15:32,760 --> 00:15:33,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Let's go.</font></font>

465
00:15:34,280 --> 00:15:35,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Okay.</font></font>

466
00:15:51,200 --> 00:15:52,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">When you were studying abroad,</font></font>

467
00:15:52,040 --> 00:15:53,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">did you ride a lot?</font></font>

468
00:15:55,360 --> 00:15:55,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Sometimes.</font></font>

469
00:15:55,840 --> 00:15:57,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I'd ride an e-bike.</font></font>

470
00:15:57,320 --> 00:15:58,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">You know?</font></font>

471
00:15:58,320 --> 00:15:59,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">The kind with pedal assist.</font></font>

472
00:15:59,440 --> 00:16:00,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Yeah.</font></font>

473
00:16:08,080 --> 00:16:09,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">This feels so nice.</font></font>

474
00:16:11,880 --> 00:16:13,760
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">What a rush. We're going so fast!</font></font>

475
00:16:15,000 --> 00:16:15,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Yeah.</font></font>

476
00:16:16,800 --> 00:16:17,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">With these bikes...</font></font>

477
00:16:17,440 --> 00:16:19,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">There's a limit to how fast you can go, right?</font></font>

478
00:16:19,320 --> 00:16:21,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">You can't go that fast.</font></font>

479
00:16:28,840 --> 00:16:29,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Let's go watch the sunset.</font></font>

480
00:17:36,120 --> 00:17:37,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Do you ride often?</font></font>

481
00:17:38,240 --> 00:17:39,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Yeah, pretty often.</font></font>

482
00:17:41,040 --> 00:17:42,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Back home I only ride share bikes.</font></font>

483
00:17:42,560 --> 00:17:44,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I don't have a license yet.</font></font>

484
00:17:44,080 --> 00:17:44,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">You don't have a license?</font></font>

485
00:17:44,840 --> 00:17:45,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">No.</font></font>

486
00:17:47,760 --> 00:17:48,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Still no license.</font></font>

487
00:17:48,880 --> 00:17:50,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Did you just never take the test,</font></font>

488
00:17:50,360 --> 00:17:51,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">or are you not allowed to...</font></font>

489
00:17:51,680 --> 00:17:52,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I mean, are you...</font></font>

490
00:17:52,840 --> 00:17:54,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">You're definitely old enough.</font></font>

491
00:17:54,600 --> 00:17:55,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">It's just...</font></font>

492
00:17:55,040 --> 00:17:55,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I just...</font></font>

493
00:17:56,880 --> 00:17:58,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I didn't finish the test.</font></font>

494
00:17:58,560 --> 00:17:59,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I got partway through</font></font>

495
00:17:59,680 --> 00:18:01,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">and never went back.</font></font>

496
00:18:01,640 --> 00:18:02,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">The road test?</font></font>

497
00:18:03,160 --> 00:18:03,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Yeah.</font></font>

498
00:18:05,640 --> 00:18:06,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Why didn't you go back?</font></font>

499
00:18:07,160 --> 00:18:08,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I haven't been home much since.</font></font>

500
00:18:15,120 --> 00:18:16,280
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Give me your phone.</font></font>

501
00:18:16,280 --> 00:18:17,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Did you bring it?</font></font>

502
00:18:17,320 --> 00:18:17,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I did.</font></font>

503
00:18:25,760 --> 00:18:28,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">[Qian Shihan and Gao Yuheng on screen]
Why is their couple photo on your phone?</font></font>

504
00:18:28,160 --> 00:18:29,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I changed it ages ago.</font></font>

505
00:18:29,080 --> 00:18:29,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Let's take a photo.</font></font>

506
00:18:33,840 --> 00:18:34,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Can you hold it up?</font></font>

507
00:18:34,840 --> 00:18:35,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">A little higher.</font></font>

508
00:18:35,640 --> 00:18:37,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Makes my face look smaller. Thanks.</font></font>

509
00:18:48,520 --> 00:18:50,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Wait. My hair's a mess.</font></font>

510
00:18:51,160 --> 00:18:52,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Hold on, let me try another angle.</font></font>

511
00:18:52,560 --> 00:18:53,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I'll do it myself.</font></font>

512
00:18:59,960 --> 00:19:00,760
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">This looks good.</font></font>

513
00:19:00,760 --> 00:19:02,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">[Happily agrees]</font></font>

514
00:19:02,120 --> 00:19:05,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">[Our first photo together at sunset]</font></font>

515
00:19:05,400 --> 00:19:06,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Yeah, let's go.</font></font>

516
00:19:06,720 --> 00:19:07,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Okay, I'll let her go first.</font></font>

517
00:19:09,360 --> 00:19:09,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Let's go.</font></font>

518
00:19:10,600 --> 00:19:11,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">My bag.</font></font>

519
00:19:15,600 --> 00:19:16,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Walk a little faster.</font></font>

520
00:19:17,360 --> 00:19:18,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">[Admiring the photo]
You walk like a koala too, huh?</font></font>

521
00:19:18,440 --> 00:19:19,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Pretty good.</font></font>

522
00:19:21,000 --> 00:19:21,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Isn't it?</font></font>

523
00:19:21,440 --> 00:19:22,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I don't like it.</font></font>

524
00:19:23,400 --> 00:19:26,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I remember he loves watching sunsets.</font></font>

525
00:19:26,000 --> 00:19:27,280
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I love watching sunsets too.</font></font>

526
00:19:27,280 --> 00:19:29,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">The weather right then,</font></font>

527
00:19:29,880 --> 00:19:32,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">the breeze, the whole feeling...</font></font>

528
00:19:32,320 --> 00:19:34,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I wanted to hang on to it for a moment.</font></font>

529
00:19:34,800 --> 00:19:35,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I also felt</font></font>

530
00:19:35,800 --> 00:19:37,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">that when I made my choice earlier,</font></font>

531
00:19:37,160 --> 00:19:39,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I hadn't considered how he felt.</font></font>

532
00:19:39,200 --> 00:19:41,760
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">He'd been uncomfortable that day.</font></font>

533
00:19:41,760 --> 00:19:43,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">It was awkward for him, too.</font></font>

534
00:19:43,080 --> 00:19:44,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I wanted to make it up to him a little.</font></font>

535
00:19:44,880 --> 00:19:47,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Ride bikes together</font></font>

536
00:19:47,040 --> 00:19:48,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">and just relax.</font></font>

537
00:19:49,160 --> 00:19:53,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">[My heart skips as I turn to see you against the sunset]</font></font>

538
00:19:55,080 --> 00:19:56,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Lucky you two.</font></font>

539
00:19:56,000 --> 00:19:57,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">We've been here working away.</font></font>

540
00:19:57,360 --> 00:19:58,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">[Teasing]
You two went on a date.</font></font>

541
00:19:58,400 --> 00:20:00,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Weren't we working hard pedaling?</font></font>

542
00:20:00,800 --> 00:20:01,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">[No excuses]
Since when is cycling a date?</font></font>

543
00:20:05,120 --> 00:20:05,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Come on. Let's cook.</font></font>

544
00:20:07,720 --> 00:20:08,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Xixi.</font></font>

545
00:20:08,120 --> 00:20:09,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Need any help?</font></font>

546
00:20:09,880 --> 00:20:11,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Ren Chunxi can't cook, you know.</font></font>

547
00:20:11,720 --> 00:20:12,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Okay, then.</font></font>

548
00:20:12,080 --> 00:20:12,760
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">[She's no head chef]</font></font>

549
00:20:12,760 --> 00:20:14,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">You've washed the vegetables, right?</font></font>

550
00:20:14,080 --> 00:20:14,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Yeah, they're washed.</font></font>

551
00:20:14,720 --> 00:20:15,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">[Chef and sous-chef]
Then mince the garlic.</font></font>

552
00:20:15,320 --> 00:20:16,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Mince the garlic. Got it.</font></font>

553
00:20:16,240 --> 00:20:17,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Do plenty. I'll need some too.</font></font>

554
00:20:17,400 --> 00:20:18,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Okay.</font></font>

555
00:20:18,960 --> 00:20:19,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">What are...</font></font>

556
00:20:19,400 --> 00:20:20,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">What are you making with this?</font></font>

557
00:20:21,040 --> 00:20:22,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Cai Ziyi</font></font>

558
00:20:22,040 --> 00:20:24,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">wants to make pork and peppers.</font></font>

559
00:20:24,120 --> 00:20:25,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I'll finish peeling the garlic, then help her.</font></font>

560
00:20:28,360 --> 00:20:29,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">There. Yeah.</font></font>

561
00:20:31,560 --> 00:20:32,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Are you okay?</font></font>

562
00:20:32,560 --> 00:20:33,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">[She cut her finger]</font></font>

563
00:20:35,160 --> 00:20:36,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">What happened?</font></font>

564
00:20:36,400 --> 00:20:38,280
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">She cut her hand.</font></font>

565
00:20:38,280 --> 00:20:39,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Ziyi cut her finger.</font></font>

566
00:20:40,920 --> 00:20:41,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Run it under water, quick.</font></font>

567
00:20:41,800 --> 00:20:42,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Run it under water, quick.</font></font>

568
00:20:42,480 --> 00:20:43,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">What happened?</font></font>

569
00:20:43,360 --> 00:20:44,280
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I cut myself.</font></font>

570
00:20:44,280 --> 00:20:45,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Get it under water.</font></font>

571
00:20:46,360 --> 00:20:48,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Hi, could I get some iodine?</font></font>

572
00:20:49,400 --> 00:20:50,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Do we have any bandages?</font></font>

573
00:20:50,720 --> 00:20:51,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Coming.</font></font>

574
00:20:51,320 --> 00:20:51,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Put pressure on it first.</font></font>

575
00:20:51,960 --> 00:20:53,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Hold it down, then disinfect it.</font></font>

576
00:20:53,400 --> 00:20:54,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">It's...</font></font>

577
00:20:54,760 --> 00:20:55,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">By the door.</font></font>

578
00:20:55,480 --> 00:20:56,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">It's tiny.</font></font>

579
00:20:56,480 --> 00:20:59,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I really just need a bandage.</font></font>

580
00:21:00,200 --> 00:21:01,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">[Following to help]
It's okay. It's a tiny cut.</font></font>

581
00:21:01,560 --> 00:21:03,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Just a bandage will do.</font></font>

582
00:21:04,760 --> 00:21:05,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Sit here.</font></font>

583
00:21:06,440 --> 00:21:07,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Does it hurt?</font></font>

584
00:21:07,240 --> 00:21:08,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">A lot, actually.</font></font>

585
00:21:08,800 --> 00:21:10,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">You know how I went like this?</font></font>

586
00:21:10,520 --> 00:21:11,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I cut straight into it.</font></font>

587
00:21:12,800 --> 00:21:14,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">The waterproof kind, right?</font></font>

588
00:21:15,200 --> 00:21:17,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">[Helping dress her cut]</font></font>

589
00:21:23,040 --> 00:21:23,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Feng.</font></font>

590
00:21:23,400 --> 00:21:24,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">What do I do with these noodles?</font></font>

591
00:21:24,360 --> 00:21:25,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Feng.</font></font>

592
00:21:25,560 --> 00:21:26,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I'll be quick. Turn off the heat for me.</font></font>

593
00:21:27,160 --> 00:21:28,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I'll turn it off.</font></font>

594
00:21:28,600 --> 00:21:29,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Okay.</font></font>

595
00:21:29,840 --> 00:21:30,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Thanks.</font></font>

596
00:21:31,880 --> 00:21:32,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Thanks.</font></font>

597
00:21:34,360 --> 00:21:37,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">[Back in action]
My chicken thighs.</font></font>

598
00:21:37,640 --> 00:21:38,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Wait for me.</font></font>

599
00:21:39,280 --> 00:21:40,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I'm coming.</font></font>

600
00:21:40,560 --> 00:21:41,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Cut this bit off, right?</font></font>

601
00:21:42,360 --> 00:21:43,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Is the garlic ready?</font></font>

602
00:21:43,440 --> 00:21:44,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">The garlic's ready, right?</font></font>

603
00:21:44,560 --> 00:21:45,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Is it ready?</font></font>

604
00:21:46,040 --> 00:21:47,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Want me to chop it?</font></font>

605
00:21:47,240 --> 00:21:48,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I'll be a bit faster.</font></font>

606
00:21:48,080 --> 00:21:48,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Sure.</font></font>

607
00:21:48,560 --> 00:21:49,280
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">This...</font></font>

608
00:21:49,760 --> 00:21:50,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I want to learn.</font></font>

609
00:21:51,200 --> 00:21:51,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">[A garlic-chopping lesson]
You just...</font></font>

610
00:21:51,800 --> 00:21:52,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">You just...</font></font>

611
00:21:53,480 --> 00:21:54,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Let me.</font></font>

612
00:21:54,080 --> 00:21:55,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">No, look. It's like this.</font></font>

613
00:21:57,920 --> 00:21:59,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">[Another casualty]</font></font>

614
00:22:00,600 --> 00:22:02,280
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Over there. Here, this way.</font></font>

615
00:22:03,440 --> 00:22:05,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">How'd someone else get hurt?</font></font>

616
00:22:05,080 --> 00:22:05,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I cut myself.</font></font>

617
00:22:06,160 --> 00:22:07,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">[Awkward]
Who cut themselves?</font></font>

618
00:22:07,320 --> 00:22:08,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Dong.</font></font>

619
00:22:08,080 --> 00:22:08,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">What happened?</font></font>

620
00:22:08,800 --> 00:22:10,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I've never cut myself cooking.</font></font>

621
00:22:10,360 --> 00:22:12,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">[Even the pro slips up]
That's embarrassing, Mr. Thunder.</font></font>

622
00:22:12,160 --> 00:22:14,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Pretty embarrassing at a time like this.</font></font>

623
00:22:14,120 --> 00:22:14,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I was showing him</font></font>

624
00:22:14,960 --> 00:22:16,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">how to mince the garlic and...</font></font>

625
00:22:16,920 --> 00:22:17,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Are you okay?</font></font>

626
00:22:17,880 --> 00:22:18,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I'm fine.</font></font>

627
00:22:19,720 --> 00:22:20,760
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Is it a big cut?</font></font>

628
00:22:20,760 --> 00:22:21,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">[Coming over to check]
It's a bit deep. Hang on.</font></font>

629
00:22:22,840 --> 00:22:24,280
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I don't think a bandage will stop it.</font></font>

630
00:22:25,480 --> 00:22:26,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I have some in my room.</font></font>

631
00:22:26,880 --> 00:22:28,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I've got bigger ones in my room.</font></font>

632
00:22:28,960 --> 00:22:31,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I wonder if there's a medic around.</font></font>

633
00:22:31,840 --> 00:22:32,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">[Goes with him to find a medic]</font></font>

634
00:22:36,920 --> 00:22:38,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I've never cut myself cooking.</font></font>

635
00:22:38,960 --> 00:22:40,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I was showing someone how to do it,</font></font>

636
00:22:40,480 --> 00:22:41,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">and I cut myself.</font></font>

637
00:22:41,040 --> 00:22:41,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">That's never happened before.</font></font>

638
00:22:41,880 --> 00:22:42,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Hi.</font></font>

639
00:22:42,880 --> 00:22:44,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Do you have a slightly bigger bandage?</font></font>

640
00:22:46,080 --> 00:22:47,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I can't believe this.</font></font>

641
00:22:47,120 --> 00:22:47,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Everyone's been a bit...</font></font>

642
00:22:47,960 --> 00:22:48,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">It's okay.</font></font>

643
00:22:48,320 --> 00:22:49,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I cut myself a little while ago too.</font></font>

644
00:22:49,640 --> 00:22:50,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Careful with that. Careful.</font></font>

645
00:22:50,560 --> 00:22:52,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Mine's okay. It's already...</font></font>

646
00:22:52,000 --> 00:22:53,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I can't believe I did that.</font></font>

647
00:22:53,240 --> 00:22:55,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Right? You've got to be careful.</font></font>

648
00:22:56,400 --> 00:22:57,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Is it really deep?</font></font>

649
00:22:57,600 --> 00:22:58,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Yeah, it's pretty deep.</font></font>

650
00:22:58,120 --> 00:22:59,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">How big? Let me see.</font></font>

651
00:22:59,840 --> 00:23:01,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">It's just...</font></font>

652
00:23:01,400 --> 00:23:02,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I see.</font></font>

653
00:23:02,880 --> 00:23:03,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">That hurts.</font></font>

654
00:23:03,480 --> 00:23:04,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I was showing her how to do it.</font></font>

655
00:23:04,640 --> 00:23:05,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I'll go get it.</font></font>

656
00:23:08,040 --> 00:23:09,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">It's okay.</font></font>

657
00:23:09,880 --> 00:23:11,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Give me that.</font></font>

658
00:23:12,240 --> 00:23:13,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">So embarrassing.</font></font>

659
00:23:14,760 --> 00:23:17,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Look at me, showing off and everything.</font></font>

660
00:23:17,080 --> 00:23:18,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">We're all a bunch of show-offs today.</font></font>

661
00:23:18,520 --> 00:23:19,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">[Crew]
That's so pretty.</font></font>

662
00:23:20,520 --> 00:23:21,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">So pretty.</font></font>

663
00:23:21,480 --> 00:23:22,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">It's pink again.</font></font>

664
00:23:22,440 --> 00:23:22,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Yeah.</font></font>

665
00:23:23,640 --> 00:23:25,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Isn't that one too big?</font></font>

666
00:23:25,080 --> 00:23:26,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Careful.</font></font>

667
00:23:26,040 --> 00:23:27,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">This is so embarrassing.</font></font>

668
00:23:27,480 --> 00:23:28,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">So embarrassing.</font></font>

669
00:23:28,160 --> 00:23:29,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">[Reassuring him]
No, it's nothing to be embarrassed by.</font></font>

670
00:23:29,880 --> 00:23:31,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">What's embarrassing about that?</font></font>

671
00:23:32,480 --> 00:23:36,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">[Crew]
It happens to anyone who cooks enough.</font></font>

672
00:23:36,000 --> 00:23:37,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Squeeze it tight.</font></font>

673
00:23:40,560 --> 00:23:41,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Okay, thanks. Thank you.</font></font>

674
00:23:42,240 --> 00:23:42,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Thanks.</font></font>

675
00:23:44,120 --> 00:23:44,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Is there any in here?</font></font>

676
00:23:44,720 --> 00:23:45,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">No.</font></font>

677
00:23:45,080 --> 00:23:46,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I'll do it.</font></font>

678
00:23:46,120 --> 00:23:46,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">[Giving the patient a break]
It's just...</font></font>

679
00:23:47,120 --> 00:23:49,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Let me. You're making a fuss over nothing.</font></font>

680
00:23:49,600 --> 00:23:51,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">No, boil a little more.</font></font>

681
00:23:51,360 --> 00:23:52,760
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Here, let me pour a little.</font></font>

682
00:23:53,280 --> 00:23:54,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">A little more water.</font></font>

683
00:23:54,680 --> 00:23:55,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">It's kind of heavy.</font></font>

684
00:23:56,200 --> 00:23:57,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Could you turn off the water?</font></font>

685
00:23:57,240 --> 00:23:58,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Just a second.</font></font>

686
00:23:58,920 --> 00:23:59,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">That's enough.</font></font>

687
00:24:02,600 --> 00:24:03,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Is this enough?</font></font>

688
00:24:03,200 --> 00:24:04,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">It's stuck.</font></font>

689
00:24:05,480 --> 00:24:06,760
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Yeah, thanks.</font></font>

690
00:24:06,760 --> 00:24:08,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">It's stuck.</font></font>

691
00:24:10,920 --> 00:24:12,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Anything else I can do?</font></font>

692
00:24:12,720 --> 00:24:14,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">No, thanks. Haven't you started yet?</font></font>

693
00:24:14,160 --> 00:24:15,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I haven't.</font></font>

694
00:24:15,800 --> 00:24:16,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Why haven't you started?</font></font>

695
00:24:16,960 --> 00:24:19,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">All the space is taken.</font></font>

696
00:24:19,080 --> 00:24:19,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Your dish cooks fast.</font></font>

697
00:24:19,920 --> 00:24:21,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Yeah, mine doesn't take long.</font></font>

698
00:24:22,400 --> 00:24:24,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Or you could slice some beef for me.</font></font>

699
00:24:25,000 --> 00:24:25,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">How should I slice it?</font></font>

700
00:24:25,400 --> 00:24:27,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Okay. Tell me where it is.</font></font>

701
00:24:28,200 --> 00:24:29,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Making the same thing as last time?</font></font>

702
00:24:29,640 --> 00:24:31,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Yeah, same dish.</font></font>

703
00:24:31,160 --> 00:24:31,760
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Okay.</font></font>

704
00:24:35,560 --> 00:24:36,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I'll supervise.</font></font>

705
00:24:37,800 --> 00:24:39,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Like this?</font></font>

706
00:24:39,320 --> 00:24:40,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">[High praise]
That's Michelin-star quality.</font></font>

707
00:24:40,840 --> 00:24:42,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Do I take this skin off?</font></font>

708
00:24:42,120 --> 00:24:43,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">It's fine. You can leave it on.</font></font>

709
00:24:43,120 --> 00:24:44,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I'm using this,</font></font>

710
00:24:44,680 --> 00:24:45,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">so I'll just cut straight through it.</font></font>

711
00:24:45,600 --> 00:24:46,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Let me.</font></font>

712
00:24:46,640 --> 00:24:47,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I'm okay.</font></font>

713
00:24:47,640 --> 00:24:49,280
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I'll do it. I've got nothing else to do.</font></font>

714
00:24:49,280 --> 00:24:49,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Okay.</font></font>

715
00:24:52,520 --> 00:24:53,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Need me to do anything?</font></font>

716
00:24:53,600 --> 00:24:55,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Sure. Give me a bite.</font></font>

717
00:24:56,120 --> 00:24:58,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Okay. I'll get you a fork.</font></font>

718
00:24:58,480 --> 00:24:58,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Yang.</font></font>

719
00:24:58,840 --> 00:25:00,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Can I share</font></font>

720
00:25:00,040 --> 00:25:01,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">a bite of the cake?</font></font>

721
00:25:01,880 --> 00:25:02,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">With who?</font></font>

722
00:25:02,920 --> 00:25:04,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Give Ziyi a bite.</font></font>

723
00:25:04,480 --> 00:25:05,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Sure. Go ahead.</font></font>

724
00:25:05,560 --> 00:25:06,760
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I'll scoop some out, then.</font></font>

725
00:25:06,760 --> 00:25:07,280
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Go ahead.</font></font>

726
00:25:08,160 --> 00:25:08,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Ziyi.</font></font>

727
00:25:08,800 --> 00:25:09,760
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Let's give everyone a bite.</font></font>

728
00:25:09,760 --> 00:25:10,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Show off our baking skills.</font></font>

729
00:25:13,520 --> 00:25:14,280
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Want some?</font></font>

730
00:25:14,280 --> 00:25:15,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Yeah.</font></font>

731
00:25:16,960 --> 00:25:17,760
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I want more too.</font></font>

732
00:25:17,760 --> 00:25:18,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Okay.</font></font>

733
00:25:18,360 --> 00:25:19,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">It's good.</font></font>

734
00:25:19,760 --> 00:25:21,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I actually haven't tried it yet.</font></font>

735
00:25:21,240 --> 00:25:22,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">It's really good. Have a bite.</font></font>

736
00:25:23,040 --> 00:25:23,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Song.</font></font>

737
00:25:23,520 --> 00:25:24,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Come taste the fruits of our labor.</font></font>

738
00:25:24,520 --> 00:25:26,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Everyone says it's good, right?</font></font>

739
00:25:27,560 --> 00:25:28,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Hang on.</font></font>

740
00:25:28,080 --> 00:25:28,760
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">It's okay.</font></font>

741
00:25:28,760 --> 00:25:30,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">[The baker is here]
I'll just use my hands.</font></font>

742
00:25:31,520 --> 00:25:32,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Song.</font></font>

743
00:25:32,840 --> 00:25:33,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Can you help me...</font></font>

744
00:25:33,320 --> 00:25:34,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Tianqing, want a bite?</font></font>

745
00:25:34,240 --> 00:25:35,280
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">[Tianqing, want a bite?]</font></font>

746
00:25:35,360 --> 00:25:36,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">[Tianqing, want a bite?]
Tianqing, want a bite?</font></font>

747
00:25:37,160 --> 00:25:38,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Sure.</font></font>

748
00:25:41,160 --> 00:25:42,280
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">How much ginger do you need?</font></font>

749
00:25:42,280 --> 00:25:43,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I'll cut up the whole thing for you.</font></font>

750
00:25:43,440 --> 00:25:44,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Half is enough.</font></font>

751
00:25:46,600 --> 00:25:48,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">[He notices]</font></font>

752
00:25:49,320 --> 00:25:50,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Yang, have a bite.</font></font>

753
00:25:50,000 --> 00:25:51,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Why didn't I get the first bite?</font></font>

754
00:25:51,520 --> 00:25:53,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">[I didn't get the first bite]
Ziyi got the first bite.</font></font>

755
00:25:53,640 --> 00:25:54,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">And then I didn't...</font></font>

756
00:25:54,600 --> 00:25:56,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">[Upset]
I just went around offering it.</font></font>

757
00:25:57,680 --> 00:25:59,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">[Feeling guilty]</font></font>

758
00:26:00,480 --> 00:26:01,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Here you go.</font></font>

759
00:26:01,480 --> 00:26:03,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">[Right from the middle]
I picked the best piece for you.</font></font>

760
00:26:03,200 --> 00:26:04,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">[The best piece]
It's from right in the middle.</font></font>

761
00:26:08,400 --> 00:26:09,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Is it good?</font></font>

762
00:26:10,400 --> 00:26:10,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">It's good.</font></font>

763
00:26:10,800 --> 00:26:11,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I made this.</font></font>

764
00:26:11,600 --> 00:26:12,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Is it really good?</font></font>

765
00:26:12,680 --> 00:26:13,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">It's great.</font></font>

766
00:26:16,240 --> 00:26:16,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Yang.</font></font>

767
00:26:16,680 --> 00:26:17,760
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">It really is good.</font></font>

768
00:26:17,760 --> 00:26:18,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">It's honestly pretty good.</font></font>

769
00:26:20,040 --> 00:26:21,280
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Maybe I'm just hungry.</font></font>

770
00:26:23,440 --> 00:26:24,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I'm going to help...</font></font>

771
00:26:24,360 --> 00:26:25,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I'm going to help Wang Tianqing.</font></font>

772
00:26:26,160 --> 00:26:27,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">[I'm going to help Wang Tianqing]
Okay.</font></font>

773
00:26:28,360 --> 00:26:30,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">[She comes back]</font></font>

774
00:26:30,640 --> 00:26:32,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Is there anything you want me to do?</font></font>

775
00:26:32,600 --> 00:26:33,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">It's okay. Go ahead.</font></font>

776
00:26:33,560 --> 00:26:34,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">[Watching the drama up close]
Really?</font></font>

777
00:26:34,040 --> 00:26:34,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">[Chop, chop, chop]
Really.</font></font>

778
00:26:34,920 --> 00:26:36,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I won't lose points for it?</font></font>

779
00:26:36,080 --> 00:26:38,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">[She keeps asking]</font></font>

780
00:26:38,360 --> 00:26:41,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">That's mean. Now you're asking me again.</font></font>

781
00:26:41,200 --> 00:26:42,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">How am I supposed to answer?</font></font>

782
00:26:42,880 --> 00:26:44,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">You are unbelievable.</font></font>

783
00:26:46,520 --> 00:26:47,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">She's too much.</font></font>

784
00:26:47,720 --> 00:26:49,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">[A moment of sympathy]</font></font>

785
00:26:50,160 --> 00:26:51,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Tianqing, need any help?</font></font>

786
00:26:51,320 --> 00:26:52,280
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I can help.</font></font>

787
00:26:52,280 --> 00:26:53,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I'm nearly done prepping.</font></font>

788
00:26:53,720 --> 00:26:54,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Actually, it's all done.</font></font>

789
00:26:55,600 --> 00:26:57,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Want me to dice some potatoes?</font></font>

790
00:26:57,560 --> 00:26:58,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">[Determined to help]
Want me to dice some potatoes?</font></font>

791
00:26:58,880 --> 00:26:59,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Sure.</font></font>

792
00:27:02,240 --> 00:27:04,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Tianqing, I cut these potatoes for you.</font></font>

793
00:27:07,280 --> 00:27:08,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Great.</font></font>

794
00:27:08,640 --> 00:27:09,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Yang.</font></font>

795
00:27:09,440 --> 00:27:10,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">What can I do?</font></font>

796
00:27:10,680 --> 00:27:11,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Tianqing, need any help?</font></font>

797
00:27:12,440 --> 00:27:13,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Yang.</font></font>

798
00:27:13,160 --> 00:27:14,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I can take something off your hands.</font></font>

799
00:27:14,800 --> 00:27:16,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Tianqing, what are you making?</font></font>

800
00:27:16,240 --> 00:27:18,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Yang, let me mix that for you.</font></font>

801
00:27:18,760 --> 00:27:19,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">[Wants to help Yang]
Okay, go ahead.</font></font>

802
00:27:20,440 --> 00:27:22,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">But I really hate touching raw meat.</font></font>

803
00:27:22,480 --> 00:27:22,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">For you,</font></font>

804
00:27:22,960 --> 00:27:24,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I'm getting over my thing with raw meat.</font></font>

805
00:27:25,720 --> 00:27:26,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">[Touching raw meat just for him]
Really?</font></font>

806
00:27:26,480 --> 00:27:27,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Really.</font></font>

807
00:27:27,240 --> 00:27:28,280
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">You're doing it for me?</font></font>

808
00:27:29,600 --> 00:27:30,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">How come it bothers you so much?</font></font>

809
00:27:31,480 --> 00:27:32,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Why?</font></font>

810
00:27:32,200 --> 00:27:32,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">[Passing by]</font></font>

811
00:27:32,960 --> 00:27:34,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">You really don't cook, do you?</font></font>

812
00:27:34,160 --> 00:27:37,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I do. Raw meat just makes me uneasy.</font></font>

813
00:27:37,120 --> 00:27:38,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I know how to cook.</font></font>

814
00:27:38,320 --> 00:27:40,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I just don't enjoy it.</font></font>

815
00:27:40,520 --> 00:27:41,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">In my last relationship,</font></font>

816
00:27:41,880 --> 00:27:43,760
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I cooked for my ex a lot.</font></font>

817
00:27:43,760 --> 00:27:45,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">It started to feel like an obligation.</font></font>

818
00:27:45,560 --> 00:27:47,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">It stopped making me happy.</font></font>

819
00:27:47,480 --> 00:27:48,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Once I've handled raw meat,</font></font>

820
00:27:48,360 --> 00:27:50,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I can't really bring myself to eat it.</font></font>

821
00:27:50,200 --> 00:27:51,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Okay. Go ahead.</font></font>

822
00:27:51,560 --> 00:27:52,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">That looks perfect.</font></font>

823
00:27:54,480 --> 00:27:55,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Tianqing, need any help?</font></font>

824
00:27:56,600 --> 00:27:57,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Beef stew.</font></font>

825
00:27:57,840 --> 00:27:59,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Are you done already?</font></font>

826
00:27:59,200 --> 00:27:59,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Haven't started yet.</font></font>

827
00:27:59,840 --> 00:28:01,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Okay. How long does it need to simmer?</font></font>

828
00:28:02,040 --> 00:28:03,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I don't know. I have to look it up.</font></font>

829
00:28:04,640 --> 00:28:06,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">[Looking around]</font></font>

830
00:28:13,080 --> 00:28:14,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Go on. The fumes are awful.</font></font>

831
00:28:14,600 --> 00:28:15,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">[Worried about the fumes]
It's really smoky.</font></font>

832
00:28:15,800 --> 00:28:16,760
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I don't mind.</font></font>

833
00:28:17,960 --> 00:28:19,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I want to toss it in the pan too.</font></font>

834
