<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I just asked Dong.</font></font>

931
00:31:11,560 --> 00:31:12,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">He thought it was pretty good.</font></font>

932
00:31:12,880 --> 00:31:13,840
