937
00:31:17,880 --> 00:31:19,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I think it's really weird.</font></font>

938
00:31:20,800 --> 00:31:21,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">[Smells so good]
Smells so good.</font></font>

939
