<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I've got to try this.</font></font>

943
00:31:32,880 --> 00:31:33,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">See if it's got any flavor.</font></font>

944
00:31:33,920 --> 00:31:35,440
