<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">[Jealous]
Yeah, looks like it.</font></font>

967
00:32:22,080 --> 00:32:23,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">He definitely knows how.</font></font>

968
00:32:23,400 --> 00:32:24,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Anyway, I couldn't get a word in.</font></font>

969
00:32:25,360 --> 00:32:25,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">[Green with envy]
It hurts.</font></font>

970
