1003
00:33:49,400 --> 00:33:50,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Every ridiculous thing you can imagine,</font></font>

1004
00:33:50,320 --> 00:33:51,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">every side of Wang Tianqing you've never seen,</font></font>

1005
00:33:51,720 --> 00:33:52,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">he showed us today.</font></font>

1006
