<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">sound nothing like the guy I see?</font></font>

1011
00:33:58,440 --> 00:34:00,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">[That's not the guy I see]</font></font>

1012
00:34:00,720 --> 00:34:02,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Yeah. Why'd he go so wild today?</font></font>

1013
00:34:02,440 --> 00:34:03,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">He blew his cover.</font></font>

1014
00:34:03,600 --> 00:34:04,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I had a blast.</font></font>

1015
00:34:04,000 --> 00:34:04,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">The act is over.</font></font>

1016
00:34:04,680 --> 00:34:05,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">The act is over.</font></font>

1017
00:34:05,560 --> 00:34:07,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">It took you until Day 5</font></font>

1018
00:34:07,000 --> 00:34:08,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">to show us this side of you.</font></font>

1019
00:34:08,360 --> 00:34:09,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">When you think you're leaving, you just...</font></font>

1020
00:34:09,160 --> 00:34:10,160
