1024
00:34:25,320 --> 00:34:26,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">[Really made an effort]
Done in 20 minutes.</font></font>

1025
00:34:31,000 --> 00:34:32,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">[Sharing the results]
Come try the dish you made.</font></font>

1026
00:34:35,560 --> 00:34:36,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Want me to grab you a piece?</font></font>

1027
00:34:38,680 --> 00:34:40,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I don't want any peppers.</font></font>

1028
00:34:40,840 --> 00:34:41,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">[Giving her a bite]
These peppers smell great.</font></font>

1029
00:34:45,480 --> 00:34:46,280
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Nice work.</font></font>

1030
00:34:46,840 --> 00:34:47,760
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I want some of that...</font></font>

1031
00:34:48,720 --> 00:34:49,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Boiled shrimp.</font></font>

1032
00:34:51,080 --> 00:34:51,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Waiting for a pan.</font></font>

1033
00:34:51,960 --> 00:34:53,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">[Waiting for a pan]</font></font>

1034
00:34:58,840 --> 00:35:03,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">[Koala sneaks a bite]</font></font>

1035
