<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">What are you doing now?</font></font>

1036
00:35:05,360 --> 00:35:06,280
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">[Cake from the baking team]
It's pretty good.</font></font>

1037
00:35:06,840 --> 00:35:07,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">It's good.</font></font>

1038
00:35:07,800 --> 00:35:08,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">You've had some?</font></font>

1039
00:35:08,200 --> 00:35:09,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Of course it is. It's made with love.</font></font>

1040
00:35:09,520 --> 00:35:10,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">[Made with love]
Have you tried it?</font></font>

1041
00:35:10,320 --> 00:35:11,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I have.</font></font>

1042
00:35:11,680 --> 00:35:12,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Made with love.</font></font>

1043
00:35:15,120 --> 00:35:18,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">[Alone with his thoughts]</font></font>

1044
00:35:19,240 --> 00:35:22,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">[Even a bubbling pot can't drown out the loneliness]</font></font>

1045
00:35:22,240 --> 00:35:25,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">[Cooking alone]</font></font>

1046
00:35:32,560 --> 00:35:35,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">[Looking for ingredients]
Where's my garlic?</font></font>

1047
00:35:35,080 --> 00:35:36,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Where is it?</font></font>

1048
00:35:36,160 --> 00:35:37,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Where is it?</font></font>

1049
00:35:37,080 --> 00:35:38,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Is there any garlic left?</font></font>

1050
00:35:38,200 --> 00:35:39,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">We're out of garlic?</font></font>

1051
00:35:39,160 --> 00:35:40,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">There's more over there.</font></font>

1052
00:35:40,080 --> 00:35:40,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Peel it yourself.</font></font>

1053
00:35:41,200 --> 00:35:41,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Yeah, I noticed</font></font>

1054
00:35:43,560 --> 00:35:44,760
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Annie wasn't here the entire time.</font></font>

1055
00:35:44,880 --> 00:35:50,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">[All he can think about is Annie]</font></font>

1056
00:35:50,080 --> 00:35:50,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">No wonder I cooked a whole spread.</font></font>

1057
00:35:53,160 --> 00:35:55,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">It's fine. I'm okay on my own.</font></font>

1058
00:35:57,080 --> 00:35:59,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">[Meanwhile, Annie is fast asleep]</font></font>

1059
00:36:00,800 --> 00:36:01,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Kind of sad.</font></font>

1060
00:36:01,480 --> 00:36:02,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Did you notice I was on my own the whole time?</font></font>

1061
00:36:02,720 --> 00:36:03,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Don't be sad, bro.</font></font>

1062
00:36:03,800 --> 00:36:04,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Don't be sad, buddy.</font></font>

1063
00:36:04,800 --> 00:36:05,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">You did great.</font></font>

1064
00:36:05,360 --> 00:36:05,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Did I?</font></font>

1065
00:36:05,920 --> 00:36:06,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">You did.</font></font>

1066
00:36:06,400 --> 00:36:07,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">That great?</font></font>

1067
00:36:07,720 --> 00:36:08,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Great. Really great.</font></font>

1068
00:36:08,440 --> 00:36:09,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Weren't we right there with you?</font></font>

1069
00:36:09,400 --> 00:36:11,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">We were rooting for you the whole time.</font></font>

1070
00:36:11,120 --> 00:36:12,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I even helped cut potatoes for someone else.</font></font>

1071
00:36:12,160 --> 00:36:14,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">[Yang remembers the potatoes]
Tianqing, I cut these potatoes for you.</font></font>

1072
00:36:16,200 --> 00:36:16,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Cutting potatoes.</font></font>

1073
00:36:17,600 --> 00:36:18,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">At least there was...</font></font>

1074
00:36:18,880 --> 00:36:19,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">A little teamwork, you know?</font></font>

1075
00:36:19,520 --> 00:36:20,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Helping each other out.</font></font>

1076
00:36:20,840 --> 00:36:22,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Mine wasn't even there.</font></font>

1077
00:36:22,680 --> 00:36:23,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">[Nowhere to be seen]</font></font>

1078
00:36:24,280 --> 00:36:25,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Need a hand?</font></font>

1079
00:36:25,120 --> 00:36:25,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">No.</font></font>

1080
00:36:26,120 --> 00:36:26,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Okay.</font></font>

1081
00:36:26,720 --> 00:36:28,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">If you're good, I'll get out of here.</font></font>

1082
00:36:28,480 --> 00:36:29,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">[Sleeping in the dorm]</font></font>

1083
00:36:29,680 --> 00:36:30,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">[Chatting]</font></font>

1084
00:36:31,280 --> 00:36:32,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">[Cooking alone]
But she was on her own.</font></font>

1085
00:36:32,080 --> 00:36:33,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Maybe she isn't feeling well.</font></font>

1086
00:36:33,560 --> 00:36:35,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Is she actually feeling unwell,</font></font>

1087
00:36:35,880 --> 00:36:37,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">or is it being around me?</font></font>

1088
00:36:37,800 --> 00:36:39,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">That's the question.</font></font>

1089
00:36:40,320 --> 00:36:42,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I made a poached seafood medley.</font></font>

1090
00:36:42,800 --> 00:36:43,760
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">It didn't turn out.</font></font>

1091
00:36:43,760 --> 00:36:45,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I think I was distracted.</font></font>

1092
00:36:45,080 --> 00:36:46,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I kept thinking about this afternoon.</font></font>

1093
00:36:51,000 --> 00:36:52,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Why don't you check on Annie?</font></font>

1094
00:36:52,680 --> 00:36:53,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Why don't you check on Annie?</font></font>

1095
00:36:53,920 --> 00:36:55,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">[Why don't you check on Annie?]</font></font>

1096
00:36:59,160 --> 00:37:00,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Where's Annie?</font></font>

1097
00:37:02,040 --> 00:37:02,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I don't know.</font></font>

1098
00:37:04,080 --> 00:37:04,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Did she go back to the dorm?</font></font>

1099
00:37:04,840 --> 00:37:06,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Probably. I think she felt unwell.</font></font>

1100
00:37:06,280 --> 00:37:06,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Why don't you go ask?</font></font>

1101
00:37:06,720 --> 00:37:07,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I'll go get her.</font></font>

1102
00:37:15,840 --> 00:37:17,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">She helped me peel the shrimp</font></font>

1103
00:37:17,040 --> 00:37:18,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">and then disappeared.</font></font>

1104
00:37:20,440 --> 00:37:21,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Maybe she didn't want to cook with me.</font></font>

1105
00:37:21,680 --> 00:37:23,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I think she might...</font></font>

1106
00:37:23,680 --> 00:37:26,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Maybe she gets tired of me after a while.</font></font>

1107
00:37:26,200 --> 00:37:27,760
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I don't know.</font></font>

1108
00:37:27,760 --> 00:37:28,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I can't tell either.</font></font>

1109
00:37:28,920 --> 00:37:32,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">But I was pretty tired, too,</font></font>

1110
00:37:32,520 --> 00:37:35,280
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">and I didn't want to go get her.</font></font>

1111
00:37:35,280 --> 00:37:36,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I didn't want to bother her.</font></font>

1112
00:37:40,440 --> 00:37:41,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">[Humming happily as he goes]</font></font>

1113
00:37:41,200 --> 00:37:44,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I see the good in you. If only you knew.</font></font>

1114
00:37:44,960 --> 00:37:49,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Thinking of you could be my favorite thing to do.</font></font>

1115
00:37:52,840 --> 00:37:54,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Annie.</font></font>

1116
00:37:54,000 --> 00:37:54,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Anyone here?</font></font>

1117
00:37:56,320 --> 00:37:57,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Dinner's ready.</font></font>

1118
00:37:57,160 --> 00:37:58,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Okay.</font></font>

1119
00:37:58,360 --> 00:37:59,760
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">[Checking on her]
Is your stomach bothering you?</font></font>

1120
00:37:59,760 --> 00:38:00,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">No.</font></font>

1121
00:38:00,200 --> 00:38:01,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I was just really sleepy.</font></font>

1122
00:38:01,600 --> 00:38:03,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">[Waiting at the bottom of the steps]</font></font>

1123
00:38:10,680 --> 00:38:11,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">They're all done cooking?</font></font>

1124
00:38:11,920 --> 00:38:12,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Everyone's done.</font></font>

1125
00:38:12,520 --> 00:38:13,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Sorry.</font></font>

1126
00:38:13,000 --> 00:38:14,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I barely helped at all.</font></font>

1127
00:38:14,080 --> 00:38:15,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I was so tired.</font></font>

1128
00:38:15,040 --> 00:38:16,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I kind of gave up and went to lie down.</font></font>

1129
00:38:16,800 --> 00:38:17,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I was making soup.</font></font>

1130
00:38:17,680 --> 00:38:19,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">With Cantonese soup,</font></font>

1131
00:38:19,160 --> 00:38:20,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">you just set it to simmer and leave it.</font></font>

1132
00:38:20,400 --> 00:38:21,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">You don't even need to season it.</font></font>

1133
00:38:21,680 --> 00:38:23,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">So your soup's done?</font></font>

1134
00:38:23,440 --> 00:38:24,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">No, it isn't.</font></font>

1135
00:38:24,440 --> 00:38:25,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">But I think they've started eating.</font></font>

1136
00:38:26,560 --> 00:38:27,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">They cook so fast.</font></font>

1137
00:38:27,880 --> 00:38:28,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">They do.</font></font>

1138
00:38:28,240 --> 00:38:30,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">They're all making stir-fries,</font></font>

1139
00:38:30,120 --> 00:38:30,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">so it's quicker.</font></font>

1140
00:38:30,880 --> 00:38:31,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I kind of forgot</font></font>

1141
00:38:31,640 --> 00:38:32,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">when I put my soup on.</font></font>

1142
00:38:32,560 --> 00:38:33,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">In theory,</font></font>

1143
00:38:33,200 --> 00:38:35,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">according to my friend's recipe,</font></font>

1144
00:38:35,920 --> 00:38:37,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">it takes exactly 2 hours.</font></font>

1145
00:38:37,640 --> 00:38:39,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">But today I was missing</font></font>

1146
00:38:39,120 --> 00:38:40,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">half the ingredients, so</font></font>

1147
00:38:41,560 --> 00:38:43,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I figured I didn't need to be that precise.</font></font>

1148
00:38:43,200 --> 00:38:44,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">True.</font></font>

1149
00:38:47,520 --> 00:38:48,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Smells great.</font></font>

1150
00:38:49,200 --> 00:38:50,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Hi, everyone.</font></font>

1151
00:38:51,280 --> 00:38:52,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">That smells amazing.</font></font>

1152
00:38:53,960 --> 00:38:54,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">How do you feel?</font></font>

1153
00:38:54,800 --> 00:38:55,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Are you okay?</font></font>

1154
00:38:56,800 --> 00:38:57,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Hold on.</font></font>

1155
00:38:59,600 --> 00:39:00,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I was fine until I walked in.</font></font>

1156
00:39:05,480 --> 00:39:07,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">That goes...</font></font>

1157
00:39:07,840 --> 00:39:09,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Put it in the middle.</font></font>

1158
00:39:09,040 --> 00:39:10,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Okay.</font></font>

1159
00:39:10,000 --> 00:39:10,880
