1512
00:53:28,800 --> 00:53:29,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">[Helping steady it]
Get your feet set first.</font></font>

1513
00:53:31,120 --> 00:53:31,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Careful.</font></font>

1514
00:53:31,840 --> 00:53:32,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Okay, you're good.</font></font>

1515
00:53:32,960 --> 00:53:33,520
