1516
00:53:33,520 --> 00:53:35,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Hold it right here.</font></font>

1517
00:53:35,120 --> 00:53:35,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Okay, thanks.</font></font>

1518
00:53:40,480 --> 00:53:41,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I've never done this before.</font></font>

1519
00:53:42,400 --> 00:53:43,600
