1520
00:53:43,600 --> 00:53:44,280
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Me neither.</font></font>

1521
00:53:45,160 --> 00:53:45,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Careful.</font></font>

1522
