<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Who's that?</font></font>

1585
00:57:36,200 --> 00:57:37,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Tianqing and Yuning.</font></font>

1586
00:57:43,200 --> 00:57:45,040
