<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I thought that was you.</font></font>

1589
00:58:03,480 --> 00:58:05,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">[She thought that was him]</font></font>

1590
00:58:05,800 --> 00:58:07,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Wait, who's with who?</font></font>

1591
00:58:07,160 --> 00:58:08,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Tianqing and Yuning.</font></font>

1592
00:58:11,160 --> 00:58:12,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I thought that was you.</font></font>

1593
00:58:12,720 --> 00:58:13,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">You thought it was me?</font></font>

1594
00:58:19,880 --> 00:58:21,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Why didn't you come find me later?</font></font>

1595
00:58:21,920 --> 00:58:22,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I did come find you.</font></font>

1596
00:58:22,360 --> 00:58:23,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I came to see you. What did I say?</font></font>

1597
00:58:23,640 --> 00:58:25,400
