1599
00:58:27,040 --> 00:58:28,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Yeah, but...</font></font>

1600
00:58:28,480 --> 00:58:29,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">You didn't tell me anything.</font></font>

1601
00:58:29,600 --> 00:58:30,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">And I didn't get a chance</font></font>

1602
00:58:30,560 --> 00:58:32,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">to talk to you about it.</font></font>

1603
00:58:32,600 --> 00:58:33,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I did tell you.</font></font>

1604
00:58:33,240 --> 00:58:35,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I told you then.</font></font>

1605
00:58:35,040 --> 00:58:35,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Wasn't Yang</font></font>

1606
00:58:35,880 --> 00:58:36,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">in your room?</font></font>

1607
