<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Yeah.</font></font>

1608
00:58:37,800 --> 00:58:39,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Right? And then I...</font></font>

1609
00:58:39,000 --> 00:58:39,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Didn't I tell you?</font></font>

1610
00:58:39,720 --> 00:58:41,760
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I said you weren't feeling well,</font></font>

1611
00:58:41,760 --> 00:58:43,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">so you should rest and we'd cancel.</font></font>

1612
00:58:43,720 --> 00:58:44,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Isn't that what I said?</font></font>

1613
00:58:46,240 --> 00:58:48,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">What would you have said on the date?</font></font>

1614
00:58:48,520 --> 00:58:50,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">[What would he have said on their date?]</font></font>

1615
00:58:50,040 --> 00:58:52,760
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I would've asked you.</font></font>

1616
00:58:52,760 --> 00:58:53,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Because I think</font></font>

1617
00:58:55,400 --> 00:58:57,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Yang's handled everything really well.</font></font>

1618
