<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">He's really good at...</font></font>

1619
00:59:00,400 --> 00:59:03,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">[Liu Xinran]</font></font>

1620
00:59:03,960 --> 00:59:05,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">How do I put this? He's good at</font></font>

1621
00:59:07,000 --> 00:59:08,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">taking care of people.</font></font>

1622
00:59:08,360 --> 00:59:09,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I think he's done a great job.</font></font>

1623
00:59:09,720 --> 00:59:11,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">But if...</font></font>

1624
00:59:11,400 --> 00:59:12,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">if we'd gone on that date yesterday,</font></font>

1625
00:59:12,680 --> 00:59:13,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I would've asked you straight up.</font></font>

1626
00:59:13,480 --> 00:59:14,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I'd have asked you</font></font>

1627
00:59:14,360 --> 00:59:15,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">where things stood.</font></font>

1628
00:59:15,720 --> 00:59:17,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Because I don't want to...</font></font>

1629
00:59:17,240 --> 00:59:18,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I've never</font></font>

1630
00:59:18,480 --> 00:59:21,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">been in a situation where I</font></font>

1631
00:59:21,480 --> 00:59:22,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">[He's never competed with another guy like this]</font></font>

1632
00:59:22,960 --> 00:59:24,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">had to compete with another guy like this.</font></font>

1633
00:59:24,120 --> 00:59:24,760
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I've never done it.</font></font>

1634
00:59:24,760 --> 00:59:26,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">And I don't like doing it.</font></font>

1635
00:59:27,800 --> 00:59:28,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I think Yang</font></font>

1636
00:59:28,560 --> 00:59:31,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">is really good to all the girls.</font></font>

1637
00:59:31,320 --> 00:59:32,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">He's good at looking after everyone.</font></font>

1638
00:59:32,840 --> 00:59:33,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">He really is.</font></font>

1639
00:59:33,920 --> 00:59:34,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Yeah.</font></font>

1640
00:59:34,600 --> 00:59:36,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">And you like that about him, right?</font></font>

1641
00:59:36,160 --> 00:59:38,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">[You like that about him, right?]</font></font>

1642
00:59:38,640 --> 00:59:40,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">He feels like a little brother to me.</font></font>

1643
00:59:40,560 --> 00:59:42,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I've never dated a younger guy.</font></font>

1644
00:59:42,840 --> 00:59:43,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I might've talked to younger guys,</font></font>

1645
00:59:43,800 --> 00:59:44,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">but I haven't dated one.</font></font>

1646
00:59:44,680 --> 00:59:46,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I always feel like</font></font>

1647
00:59:46,520 --> 00:59:48,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">they might be less mature or whatever.</font></font>

1648
00:59:49,560 --> 00:59:51,280
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">What I really want to explain is</font></font>

1649
00:59:51,280 --> 00:59:51,760
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">why I picked</font></font>

1650
00:59:51,760 --> 00:59:52,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Yang today.</font></font>

1651
00:59:52,520 --> 00:59:53,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">It was because</font></font>

1652
00:59:53,840 --> 00:59:55,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I'd promised to team up with him.</font></font>

1653
00:59:55,360 --> 00:59:56,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">It was on the second day.</font></font>

1654
00:59:56,600 --> 00:59:58,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I think it was because of a bet.</font></font>

1655
00:59:58,120 --> 01:00:00,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">But I still picked you that day.</font></font>

1656
01:00:00,640 --> 01:00:02,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">We spent the whole day taking pictures.</font></font>

1657
01:00:03,400 --> 01:00:04,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">And he said I still had</font></font>

1658
01:00:04,720 --> 01:00:06,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">to keep our promise.</font></font>

1659
01:00:06,960 --> 01:00:07,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">So...</font></font>

1660
01:00:08,640 --> 01:00:09,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">And when I was sick,</font></font>

1661
01:00:09,720 --> 01:00:11,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">he kept looking after me.</font></font>

1662
01:00:12,080 --> 01:00:13,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">That's why I chose him today.</font></font>

1663
01:00:13,720 --> 01:00:14,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">But...</font></font>

1664
01:00:14,720 --> 01:00:16,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Whenever we vote at night,</font></font>

1665
01:00:16,240 --> 01:00:18,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I've given you Moonstones.</font></font>

1666
01:00:18,880 --> 01:00:21,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">[I've voted for you every night]</font></font>

1667
01:00:21,240 --> 01:00:22,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">That's okay.</font></font>

1668
01:00:24,240 --> 01:00:27,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">But honestly,</font></font>

1669
01:00:27,840 --> 01:00:32,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">when it comes to who I was drawn to right away,</font></font>

1670
01:00:32,000 --> 01:00:33,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I think I'm leaning more</font></font>

1671
01:00:34,600 --> 01:00:35,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">toward you.</font></font>

1672
01:00:35,680 --> 01:00:36,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">[She felt drawn to him right away]
Toward you.</font></font>

1673
01:00:36,840 --> 01:00:37,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">That's how I feel.</font></font>

1674
01:00:41,640 --> 01:00:43,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Do you usually wait for others to make a move?</font></font>

1675
01:00:43,240 --> 01:00:44,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I wouldn't say I do.</font></font>

1676
01:00:44,120 --> 01:00:45,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">But I'm not going to</font></font>

1677
01:00:45,360 --> 01:00:48,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">get into that with another guy.</font></font>

1678
01:00:48,320 --> 01:00:49,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I know what you mean.</font></font>

1679
01:00:49,080 --> 01:00:50,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">If you see another guy</font></font>

1680
01:00:50,360 --> 01:00:52,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">already making it clear he's interested,</font></font>

1681
01:00:52,240 --> 01:00:53,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">you'll...</font></font>

1682
01:00:53,800 --> 01:00:54,280
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">It's not quite that.</font></font>

1683
01:00:54,280 --> 01:00:54,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">It's because</font></font>

1684
01:00:54,800 --> 01:00:56,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">It's not like you don't like him.</font></font>

1685
01:00:56,880 --> 01:00:58,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">[It's not like you don't like him]</font></font>

1686
01:00:59,840 --> 01:01:01,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">But it's only Day 5.</font></font>

1687
01:01:02,320 --> 01:01:03,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Let's just take it slow.</font></font>

1688
01:01:03,200 --> 01:01:04,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">[Take it slow]</font></font>

1689
01:01:07,600 --> 01:01:10,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">[Liu Yuning: What makes you think I like him?]</font></font>

1690
01:01:10,320 --> 01:01:12,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">[Wang Tianqing: You go looking for him too]</font></font>

1691
01:01:12,240 --> 01:01:13,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I saw you cooking together.</font></font>

1692
01:01:13,960 --> 01:01:15,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">You seemed happy this afternoon.</font></font>

1693
01:01:15,560 --> 01:01:16,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">So I thought...</font></font>

1694
01:01:16,040 --> 01:01:16,760
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">This afternoon?</font></font>

1695
01:01:16,760 --> 01:01:17,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Our afternoon was pretty uneventful.</font></font>

1696
01:01:18,800 --> 01:01:20,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I heard your group had a blast, though.</font></font>

1697
01:01:20,800 --> 01:01:21,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">And it sounds like</font></font>

1698
01:01:21,720 --> 01:01:23,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">you're starting to come out of your shell.</font></font>

1699
01:01:23,840 --> 01:01:24,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">The way you are around them</font></font>

1700
01:01:24,560 --> 01:01:26,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">seems different</font></font>

1701
01:01:26,080 --> 01:01:27,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">from the side of you I see.</font></font>

1702
01:01:27,520 --> 01:01:28,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">[You're different around other people]</font></font>

1703
01:01:28,440 --> 01:01:29,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">That's how it seems to me.</font></font>

1704
01:01:29,040 --> 01:01:31,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Yesterday,</font></font>

1705
01:01:33,400 --> 01:01:34,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I was really upset.</font></font>

1706
01:01:35,000 --> 01:01:36,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">What upset you?</font></font>

1707
01:01:36,520 --> 01:01:38,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I thought maybe because</font></font>

1708
01:01:38,840 --> 01:01:40,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I asked you to go on that date,</font></font>

1709
01:01:40,920 --> 01:01:43,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">you couldn't leave the island</font></font>

1710
01:01:43,640 --> 01:01:47,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">to get an IV with a fever of 39°C.</font></font>

1711
01:01:47,240 --> 01:01:48,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I felt like I was holding you back.</font></font>

1712
01:01:48,800 --> 01:01:50,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">And I felt helpless.</font></font>

1713
01:01:50,320 --> 01:01:51,280
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I wanted to help,</font></font>

1714
01:01:51,280 --> 01:01:52,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">but there was nothing I could do.</font></font>

1715
01:01:52,400 --> 01:01:53,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I told the others</font></font>

1716
01:01:53,000 --> 01:01:57,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I'd spend the survival points I won today</font></font>

1717
01:01:57,160 --> 01:01:58,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">to get you help.</font></font>

1718
01:02:00,800 --> 01:02:02,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">When it's just the two of us,</font></font>

1719
01:02:02,440 --> 01:02:05,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">you answer if I ask you something.</font></font>

1720
01:02:05,240 --> 01:02:06,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">But you don't start a conversation</font></font>

1721
01:02:06,640 --> 01:02:07,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">or anything like that.</font></font>

1722
01:02:07,840 --> 01:02:10,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Today, you were totally different with her.</font></font>

1723
01:02:10,680 --> 01:02:12,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">There was no pressure.</font></font>

1724
01:02:14,120 --> 01:02:16,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Do you feel that much pressure around me?</font></font>

1725
01:02:17,240 --> 01:02:18,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">[Do I make you feel pressured?]
I'm different around a girl I like</font></font>

1726
01:02:19,640 --> 01:02:23,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">than a girl I'm just friends with.</font></font>

1727
01:02:23,200 --> 01:02:24,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I'm in a completely different headspace.</font></font>

1728
01:02:24,840 --> 01:02:25,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Honestly,</font></font>

1729
01:02:27,120 --> 01:02:28,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">if I like you,</font></font>

1730
01:02:28,000 --> 01:02:30,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I'm going to be a little more careful.</font></font>

1731
01:02:32,280 --> 01:02:33,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Well, I think</font></font>

1732
01:02:33,400 --> 01:02:35,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">we can still get to know each other.</font></font>

1733
01:02:36,800 --> 01:02:39,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">[Getting to know each other]
Let's just take it slow.</font></font>

1734
01:02:39,160 --> 01:02:39,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Okay.</font></font>

1735
01:02:42,680 --> 01:02:43,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Let me tell you guys something.</font></font>

1736
01:02:43,880 --> 01:02:44,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">What's up?</font></font>

1737
01:02:44,560 --> 01:02:45,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">When I came back just now,</font></font>

1738
01:02:45,440 --> 01:02:49,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I saw Wang Tianqing with Liu Yuning.</font></font>

1739
01:02:49,360 --> 01:02:50,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">[Spotted Wang Tianqing and Liu Yuning talking]</font></font>

1740
01:02:50,280 --> 01:02:51,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">She's smooth.</font></font>

1741
01:02:52,280 --> 01:02:53,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I don't know how else to put it.</font></font>

1742
01:02:56,840 --> 01:02:58,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Yeah, we saw them too.</font></font>

1743
01:02:58,080 --> 01:02:58,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">We saw them too.</font></font>

1744
01:02:59,080 --> 01:03:00,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I gave Wang Tianqing 2 Moonstones.</font></font>

1745
01:03:03,560 --> 01:03:06,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Wang Tianqing gets 2.</font></font>

1746
01:03:06,600 --> 01:03:08,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">[Liu Xinran > Wang Tianqing: 2]
I've spent more time with Tianqing.</font></font>

1747
01:03:08,960 --> 01:03:11,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">He's got a dry sense of humor too.</font></font>

1748
01:03:12,400 --> 01:03:13,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">But isn't Yuning</font></font>

1749
01:03:13,080 --> 01:03:14,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">getting along really well</font></font>

1750
01:03:14,240 --> 01:03:15,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">with Yang too?</font></font>

1751
01:03:15,480 --> 01:03:16,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I actually think Yuning</font></font>

1752
01:03:16,560 --> 01:03:18,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">is leaning toward Wang Tianqing.</font></font>

1753
01:03:18,920 --> 01:03:19,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">[Liu Yuning is leaning toward Wang Tianqing]</font></font>

1754
01:03:19,600 --> 01:03:20,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Well, I'm screwed.</font></font>

1755
01:03:22,400 --> 01:03:24,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">There aren't many people you want to vote for.</font></font>

1756
01:03:24,640 --> 01:03:25,760
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">You finally find someone you want to pick,</font></font>

1757
01:03:25,760 --> 01:03:27,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">and this happens. That's what gets me.</font></font>

1758
01:03:27,840 --> 01:03:29,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Listen to her. She's speaking for me.</font></font>

1759
01:03:29,320 --> 01:03:29,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">[Room 4's unofficial spokesperson]</font></font>

1760
01:03:29,920 --> 01:03:31,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Of course, I'm not as emotional as she is.</font></font>

1761
01:03:34,720 --> 01:03:36,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">But I'm the kind of person who...</font></font>

1762
01:03:36,840 --> 01:03:37,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">If two of us</font></font>

1763
01:03:38,320 --> 01:03:39,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">liked the same guy,</font></font>

1764
01:03:39,320 --> 01:03:41,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I wouldn't get between them.</font></font>

1765
01:03:46,400 --> 01:03:47,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I don't know what to do.</font></font>

1766
01:03:47,800 --> 01:03:49,760
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Do you know how crazy I went today?</font></font>

1767
01:03:49,760 --> 01:03:51,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">She gave him all of hers.</font></font>

1768
01:03:51,240 --> 01:03:52,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Who got them?</font></font>

1769
01:03:53,200 --> 01:03:54,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Dong.</font></font>

1770
01:03:56,520 --> 01:03:57,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Follow your heart.</font></font>

1771
01:04:02,240 --> 01:04:04,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">[Hu Ke'er > Zheng Shoudong: 2 Moonstones]</font></font>

1772
01:04:10,200 --> 01:04:12,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">[Hu Ke'er > Zheng Shoudong: 3 Moonstones]</font></font>

1773
01:04:15,680 --> 01:04:18,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I'm losing it. I can't do this.</font></font>

1774
01:04:18,600 --> 01:04:19,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I gave him all of mine.</font></font>

1775
01:04:19,720 --> 01:04:22,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">When we were lighting fireworks or cooking,</font></font>

1776
01:04:22,200 --> 01:04:24,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">it was the little things that made me wonder</font></font>

1777
01:04:24,800 --> 01:04:26,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">if maybe he was</font></font>

1778
01:04:26,160 --> 01:04:27,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">feeling the same way I was,</font></font>

1779
01:04:27,520 --> 01:04:28,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">or something like that.</font></font>

1780
01:04:28,080 --> 01:04:30,760
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">But I'm scared</font></font>

1781
01:04:30,760 --> 01:04:32,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I'm reading too much into it.</font></font>

1782
01:04:44,080 --> 01:04:46,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">[Zheng Shoudong > Hu Ke'er: 2 Moonstones]</font></font>

1783
01:04:46,400 --> 01:04:47,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">If I absolutely had to</font></font>

1784
01:04:47,880 --> 01:04:49,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">pick one person,</font></font>

1785
01:04:49,640 --> 01:04:50,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">[Zheng Shoudong > Qian Shihan: 1]
I'd probably give all 3 Moonstones</font></font>

1786
01:04:50,320 --> 01:04:51,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">to Hu Ke'er anyway.</font></font>

1787
01:04:51,880 --> 01:04:55,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">But giving her all of mine every time</font></font>

1788
01:04:55,360 --> 01:04:57,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">would put a lot of pressure on her.</font></font>

1789
01:04:57,440 --> 01:04:59,760
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">[Doesn't want to pressure her]
Giving someone all your Moonstones</font></font>

1790
01:04:59,760 --> 01:05:01,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">doesn't mean you love them 3 or 5 times as much.</font></font>

1791
01:05:01,920 --> 01:05:03,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">That's not how I see it.</font></font>

1792
01:05:03,240 --> 01:05:04,760
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">It just means</font></font>

1793
01:05:04,760 --> 01:05:06,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">she's the only one I'm interested in.</font></font>

1794
01:05:07,760 --> 01:05:10,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">He's nice to everyone, though.</font></font>

1795
01:05:10,440 --> 01:05:12,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">[Zheng Shoudong is nice to everyone]
He's like that with everybody.</font></font>

1796
01:05:12,480 --> 01:05:15,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">But there really is something with you.</font></font>

1797
01:05:15,000 --> 01:05:16,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Everyone says so.</font></font>

1798
01:05:16,800 --> 01:05:17,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Do you like Dong?</font></font>

1799
01:05:18,200 --> 01:05:20,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">[Do you like Zheng Shoudong?]</font></font>

1800
01:05:21,400 --> 01:05:22,280
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">A little, I guess.</font></font>

1801
01:05:22,280 --> 01:05:23,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">[Do you like Zheng Shoudong? A little, I guess.]</font></font>

1802
01:05:26,760 --> 01:05:28,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I didn't vote for Gao today, though.</font></font>

1803
01:05:31,560 --> 01:05:32,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">[Zhang Yi > Tobe Lei: 2 Moonstones]</font></font>

1804
01:05:32,400 --> 01:05:33,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I gave Tobe 2 Moonstones</font></font>

1805
01:05:33,360 --> 01:05:34,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">and gave 1 Moonstone to...</font></font>

1806
01:05:34,600 --> 01:05:35,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">[Zhang Yi > Liang Yongfeng: 1 Moonstone]
Feng.</font></font>

1807
01:05:35,520 --> 01:05:36,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I picked Tobe because</font></font>

1808
01:05:36,120 --> 01:05:37,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I want to get to know him a little better.</font></font>

1809
01:05:37,680 --> 01:05:39,240
